                                                                <p><b>Let’s get started!</b><br/>
                                                                Great News - {!territory.City__c} is a proud blood collecting area serviced by an American Red Cross Blood Region. Now, let’s collect a little information about you to get you started!
                                                                </p>
                                                                </div>
                                                                </apex:outputPanel> 
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                
