                                                                <p>Unfortunately the American Red Cross does not collect blood in <b>{!territory.City__c}, {!territory.State_Code__c}</b>.</p>-->
                                                                <p class="mb-0">Unfortunately, the zip code you entered is not a zip code serviced by an American Red Cross Blood Services Region -- but you can still help! For more information on other potential blood services programs in your area, visit <a href="https://www.aabb.org">AABB.org</a> or <a href="https://www.americasblood.org">americasblood.org</a>.  Also, please consider supporting other programs at the Red Cross, visit <a href="https://www.redcross.org">redcross.org</a> for more information.
                                                                </p>
                                                                </div>
                                                                </apex:outputPanel>
                                                                
